 -fellow/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Amsterdam\, Netherlands. Fellows must be based in Amsterdam\; work
  is remote on your own computer\, with the option to work from the Hartwig
  Art Foundation offices as needed.
